{# Goal: Extract multi-dimensional ontology tags from multiple text passages in a single LLM call. #}
{#
[inference]
  Variables:
    passages_block: rendered passages with short batch-local correlation_id and source
    batch_count: number of passages
  Output: JSON array with structural judgments and raw candidate terms — exactly one correlation-ID object per passage.
  Every passage gets at least one 5W1H dimension — no zero-tag passages.
